    {
      "title": "Use of Proceeds",
      "excerpt": "USE OF PROCEEDS We expect to receive net proceeds of approximately $\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 million from the\nsale of the notes offered hereby after deducting the underwriting discounts but before offering expenses. If consummated, we estimate that the net proceeds from the concurrent offering will be approximately\n$\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0billion, after deducting the underwriting discounts but before offering expenses. The closing of this offering is not conditioned on the closing of the concurrent offering, and\nthe closing of the concurrent offering is not conditioned on the closing of this offering. There can be no assurance that the concurrent offering will be consummated on the terms described herein or at all. We intend to use the net proceeds from\nthis offering and, if consummated, the concurrent offering to refinance existing indebtedness, including borrowings under our revolving credit facility, redeem",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    },
    {
      "title": "Risk Factors",
      "excerpt": "Risk Factors Please read \u201c Risk Factors \u201d beginning on page S-8 of this prospectus supplement and on page 7 of the accompanying base prospectus for a discussion of factors you should carefully consider before investing in the notes. Concurrent Offering Concurrently with this offering of the notes, under a separate prospectus supplement, we are offering $\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0billion aggregate principal amount of our senior notes due 2034\n(the \u201c2034 notes\u201d) and $\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0billion aggregate principal amount of our senior notes due 2054 (collectively with the 2034 notes, the \u201csenior notes\u201d) in the\nconcurrent offering. The closing of this offering is not conditioned on the closing of the concurrent offering, and the closing of the concurrent offering is not conditioned on the closing of this offering, and we may sell the notes or the senior\nnotes, or both. In addition, we may sell more or fewer seni",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    }
  ],
